    <article class="post-69539 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-artifact-management category-devops category-community category-news-releases tag-bintray-2 tag-chartcenter tag-conancenter tag-gocenter tag-jcenter">
                <header>
            <h1 class="entry-title text-left">Into the Sunset on May 1st: Bintray, GoCenter, and ChartCenter</h1>
            			
<div class="entry-meta">
  <div class="d-sm-flex justify-content-between blog-meta">
        <div class="author-div d-flex flex-column justify-content-center blog-post-date">
      <div class="author-flex">
        <div class="author-img-container mr-2"><img class="author-img pt-0 pb-1" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Stephen Chin" title="Stephen Chin" data-lazy-src="https://speedmedia2.jfrog.com/08612fe1-9391-4cf3-ac1a-6dd49c36b276/media.jfrog.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/20122754/Screen-Shot-2021-05-20-at-13.27.37.png" /><noscript><img class="author-img pt-0 pb-1" src="https://speedmedia2.jfrog.com/08612fe1-9391-4cf3-ac1a-6dd49c36b276/media.jfrog.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/20122754/Screen-Shot-2021-05-20-at-13.27.37.png" alt="Stephen Chin" title="Stephen Chin" /></noscript></div>      </div>

      <p class="green m-0">
        By
                  <span class="post-author">
            <a href="https://jfrog.com/blog-author/stephen-chin/">Stephen Chin</a>          </span>
          <span class="post-time"><time class="updated" datetime="2021-02-03T14:59:28+00:00">February 3, 2021</time></span>
        
      </p>

                <p>
            <span class="post-reading-time">
                <i class="fa fa-clock-o"></i>
